{"id":"1ec9f1619fc70e88","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-relative-K-red.md","title":"Relative K Reducibility","display":"df-relative-K-red — Relative K Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-relative-K-red","aliases":["43-df-relative-K-red"],"display":"df-relative-K-red — Relative K Reducibility","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 13.7.1","source_printed_pages":"361","source_pdf_pages":"381","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-relative-K-red"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-relative-K-red</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-K-red — Relative K Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 13.7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"361"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"381"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，初段采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a> 的乘积域编码接口。以下定义二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists f:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\left((A\\upharpoonright n,j),B\\upharpoonright n\\right)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists f:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\left((A\\upharpoonright n,j),B\\upharpoonright n\\right)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个长度允许有界多个候选程序分支；正确分支可以随长度变化，故不假定统一分支。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 13.7.1；印刷页 361，PDF 页 381。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$，初段采用 [[43-df-infseq]]。$f:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的乘积域编码接口。以下定义二元关系 $\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$，初段采用 [[43-df-infseq]]。$f:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的乘积域编码接口。以下定义二元关系 $\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists f:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\left((A\\upharpoonright n,j),B\\upharpoonright n\\right)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1530,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-relative-K-red]] — Relative K Reducibility"},{"id":"e7c4e1881f3fc819","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$；归约与复杂度见 [[43-df-relative-K-red]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。"},{"id":"ea3f18feeaa80989","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}$、$K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$、$C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$ 分别采用 [[43-df-relative-K-red]]、[[43-df-condkolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]。"},{"id":"8646fc576098d22e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}$ 见 [[43-df-relative-K-red]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-turing-red]]。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","565c3258eee2a5ff"]}